            <ArticleTitle>Pancreatitis of ectopic pancreatic tissue: a rare cause of gastric outlet obstruction.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">gov037</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Inflammation in ectopic pancreatic tissue can clinically present with pain or obstructive symptoms, depending on the location of the ectopic tissue. We present a rare case of gastric outlet obstruction secondary to pancreatitis of ectopic pancreatic tissue in the pylorus.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>© The Author(s) 2015. Published by Oxford University Press and the Digestive Science Publishing Co. Limited.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
